Description: Driverless printing and scanning manager for UOS / Deepin 25
 A native DTK6 application that manages driverless (IPP-USB) printing
 and scanning: environment detection with one-click repair and offline
 install guidance, printer queue management with PPD fine-tuning,
 SANE/eSCL scanning with preview, and advanced per-device filtering
 that lets a device keep driverless printing while its scanning is
 handed back to the vendor's native SANE driver.
